# Extra user agent strings for the pool, one per line, '#' starts a comment.
#
# Only recent desktop Chrome is listed on purpose: Playwright drives a recent
# Chromium, and a Firefox or Safari string under a Chrome engine is a mismatch
# signal on its own. Extend this file if the site starts serving a newer Chrome
# than the built-in list knows about.
#
# Leave it empty to use the built-in list only.
